Z||000000||jaguiler||03-19-2001||12:33 AM||||Hello Guys & Gals,<P>Ok I just baught a used Fiero.  I read somewhere that they only made monochomatic Fieros in 87 and 88 -but mine is an 86.5 - it is #84300 out of 84900 that were made that year in the GT model. But the car is all red, the ground effects same as body. All the parts are orig. looks like orig paint. I peeled some paint and did not see any gray underniether like i expected.<BR>Is this possible?<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>______<BR>  |aguiler<BR>\/||65.8.46.102||reg||5
