Z||000002||Standard||03-19-2001||01:10 AM||||Not possible.  The only monochromatic Fiero's were the 88's.  All pre-88 Fiero's with the ground f/x originally had either silver (slate grey/silver whatever  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) or black ground f/x.  Your's isn't original, just a very good repaint.  My 86.5 GT 5 speed has the original (very faded) black upper/silver lower paint scheme.  Is yours a 5 speed?||||reg||1
